    "sections": {
        "description": "Datom is a business theme for software and digital products. The theme bundles twenty-four patterns: nineteen sectional ones, such as hero, features, numbers, how it works, pricing, FAQ, integrations and changelog, and five page patterns that put a landing, product, pricing, about or journal page together in one step. With a dark palette and lilac accents, and a pairing of three fonts, two sans-serifs and a monospace, Datom sets the tone for your digital business with a clean, modern tech look and feel."
